		{
			dependencies: ["2103000000000004"]
			description: [
				"The &eMechanical Hammer&r crushes cobble to gravel to sand to dust on Forge Energy - no durability, no clicking, no mercy. Feed it with a hopper and walk away."
				""
				"&e&lThis is the second half of Age I's automation&r - the Flux Sieve handled sifting, this handles the hammering that feeds it. Together they replace the entire manual chain you started the pack with."
				""
				"&e&lThe full hands-off line:&r"
				"&7Cobble generator &8→&7 &fMechanical Hammer&7 &8→&7 gravel &8→&7 &fFlux Sieve&7 &8→&7 ore chunks &8→&7 &fEnergized Smelter&7 &8→&7 ingots&r"
				""
				"Every stage takes FE, and every stage runs while you are asleep, in the Twilight Forest, or on Mars."
				""
				"&7Unlike a hand hammer it has no durability and never needs replacing. Unlike the Create Millstone it does not care about rotation speed or stress - it just wants power.&r"
				""
				"&8Put a filtered pipe on the output so gravel goes to the sieve and sand goes wherever you want it. Left unsorted, the hammer will happily crush its own output down to dust."
			]
			icon: "exdeorum:mechanical_hammer"
			id: "210300000000000C"
			rewards: [{
