			dependencies: ["210300000000000C"]
			description: [
				"The &eMechanical Sieve&r is the moment skyblock changes forever: powered, automatic sieving. Ore chunks, gems and seeds pour out while you build somewhere else."
				""
				"Hopper in gravel, cable in power, pipe out the loot. The hand-sieve retires today."
			]
