		}
		{
			dependencies: ["210300000000000D"]
			description: [
				"Your Mechanical Sieve quest handed you &e16 Compressed Gravel&r. This is what it was for - and the book never told you until now."
				""
				"&e9 blocks compress into 1.&r A &eCompressed Sieve&r sifts that compressed block in a single pass, rolling all nine loot chances at once. Same for the &eCompressed Hammer&r line."
				""
				"&7Cobblestone &8→&r Compressed Cobblestone &8(9:1)&r"
				"&7Compressed Hammer &8→&r Compressed Gravel &8→&r Compressed Sand &8→&r Compressed Dust&r"
				"&7Compressed Sieve + mesh &8→&r nine sieves' worth of ore, in one go&r"
				""
				"The Mechanical Sieve and Mechanical Hammer both accept compressed blocks. Feed them compressed instead of loose and your whole ore chain runs &l9x&r without another watt of power."
				""
				"&8This is the single biggest throughput jump in the pack, and nothing else in the book mentions it."
			]
